# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, The Fallen Fane — Front Matter (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** The Fallen Fane (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, credits (p. 2)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> The credits, verbatim. The printed Contents and its Cast of Characters (p. 3) are finding aids for the book’s own
> pages and are not converted — every unit they list is converted in its part. Page 1 is the cover, with no text.
> Every character sheet (pp. 15–44) carries the footer “Permission granted to photocopy for personal use. ©2004
> Atlas Games.”, printed once here and dropped from the sheets as page furniture.

